OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Fbright evening, though it will be
OL,7,Flargely cloudy. Cloud will continue to
OL,8,Fthicken overnight, with a few
OL,9,Foutbreaks of rain developing towards
OL,10,Fdawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,13,Fspreading northwards, but becoming
OL,14,Fdrier and brighter in the afternoon.
OL,15,FFurther rain spreading north in the
OL,16,Fevening heavy at times. Warm and humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
